---
_icon: icon.scroll
description: "The Typedown language: vaults, documents, schemas, type system, expressions, and file references."
---

The Typedown language is independent of any theme or tooling. Each page builds on the previous one, starting with how files are organized and ending with computed queries across your vault.

- [Vault and documents](01-vault-and-documents): project structure, file anatomy, and how content forms a graph
- [Schemas and types](02-schemas-and-types): defining node types, the type system, expressions, and file references
- [Frontmatter](03-frontmatter): all built-in `_` directives and how frontmatter fields are resolved
- [Markdown body](04-markdown-body): headings, code blocks, diagrams, math, callouts, embeds, and string interpolation
- [Custom components](05-custom-components): built-in and user-defined Vue components in the body
- [Icons](06-icons): the `icon` module and all available icon names
- [Vault query](07-vault-query): computed back-references and graph traversal across your vault
